        "required": [
          "transcript",
          "language",
          "processing_time_ms",
          "model_version"
        ],
        "title": "SpeechResult",
        "description": "Unified, model-independent representation of speech processing results.\n\nConfidence Policy:\nSenseVoiceSmall rich transcription emits greedy discrete token predictions\nand does not expose calibrated posterior probabilities for emotion or language.\nTherefore, confidence defaults to None unless an explicit logit derivation\nis provided. We never fabricate artificial confidence scores."
